lt":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":351,"closed_issues":2337,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:17:38Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":3,"created_at":"2025-06-04T19:52:20Z","updated_at":"2026-07-29T17:25:32Z","closed_at":"2026-07-29T17:25:32Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.4.1-stable, 4.3-stable\n- Much better in 4.2.2-stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.1.stable - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2060 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.7652) - AMD Ryzen 7 2700X Eight-Core Processor (16 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nIf you have a 3D scene with thousands of child nodes, switching or opening this scene or any other scene that contain it, will freeze Godot editor for 10 seconds, depending on the number and can lead to a silent crash. I couldn't reproduce the crash, but it was totally silent, even in the console.\n\nTested with empty MeshInstance3D (without mesh resource). It doesn't happen if the childs are only plain Node3Ds.\n\nIt start to freeze at around 1000 children, and it's totally unusable at 10,000.\n\nFolding the parent node seems to lower the freeze.\n\nThis issue makes 3D level design from modular kits almost impossible, because you easily end up with a high number of nodes.\n\nIt's only an issue in the Editor, no visible impact at runtime, o dynamically created nodes are not involved.\n\nTried the same setup in 4.2.2 and even with 10,000 children the time to switch was really lower (1 second)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nSwitch back and forth with the test scenes included in the reproduction project.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[test-slow-scene-switch.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20597969/test-slow-scene-switch.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5M